{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"bd187214cae644ebaa9d6c3887012c21","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"31ea70b3af278a4f86aaa53ace45867993f3","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=31ea70b3af278a4f86aaa53ace45867993f3","view_num":781,"pub_timestamp":"1708329300","title":"2월 22일 업데이트 공지","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=31ea70b3af278a4f86aaa53ace45867993f3","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"d9df831501061828010a9911a2ffabf7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"f5229755f8efebb322878e88a74ae7bc\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e존경하는\u0026nbsp;지휘관님,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e오래\u0026nbsp;기다려\u0026nbsp;주셔서\u0026nbsp;진심으로\u0026nbsp;감사드립니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검이\u0026nbsp;완료되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;보상은\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;메일함에서\u0026nbsp;확인해\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e업데이트\u0026nbsp;주요\u0026nbsp;내용:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.1\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[일레그]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e고전\u0026nbsp;명작\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;[BOOM]을\u0026nbsp;사랑하는\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[일레그]가\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집에\u0026nbsp;합류합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e일레그는\u0026nbsp;분배\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;양을\u0026nbsp;늘려주는\u0026nbsp;스킬을\u0026nbsp;가진\u0026nbsp;니케입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e또한\u0026nbsp;아군에게\u0026nbsp;이로운\u0026nbsp;효과들을\u0026nbsp;부여함과\u0026nbsp;동시에\u0026nbsp;적에게\u0026nbsp;해로운\u0026nbsp;효과를\u0026nbsp;부여해\u0026nbsp;아군의\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;효율을\u0026nbsp;높이는\u0026nbsp;니케입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;클래스:\u0026nbsp;지원형\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;무기:\u0026nbsp;붐\u0026nbsp;건(MG)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;코드:\u0026nbsp;전격\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;기업:\u0026nbsp;미실리스\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;6일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*획득처:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;대원\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*모집\u0026nbsp;안내:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①쥬얼(무료/유료)\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;고급\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓으로\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집을\u0026nbsp;진행할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;(일반\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e②특수\u0026nbsp;모집의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;4%이며,\u0026nbsp;그중\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;[일레그]의\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;2%입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e③특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e④200개의\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;모아\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;[일레그]를\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑤특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;사용하지\u0026nbsp;않은\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;소멸되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑥특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;업데이트를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;[일레그]는\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼)에선\u0026nbsp;모집할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.2\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;기능\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;사격장에서\u0026nbsp;현재\u0026nbsp;픽업\u0026nbsp;중인\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;스쿼드에\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류하여\u0026nbsp;체험하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;가능\u0026nbsp;기간:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①[일레그]:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;6일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이외,\u0026nbsp;복귀\u0026nbsp;지휘관님께서는\u0026nbsp;복귀\u0026nbsp;이벤트의\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;기능을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;체험하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.1\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;코스튬:\u0026nbsp;엑시아-게이머즈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e팬심을\u0026nbsp;숨기지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;게이머가\u0026nbsp;진정한\u0026nbsp;게이머.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[엑시아-게이머즈]는\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;Mission\u0026nbsp;Pass에서\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;MissionPass에\u0026nbsp;대한\u0026nbsp;안내는\u0026nbsp;아래\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;안내에서\u0026nbsp;확인하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.1\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;BOOMS\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;6일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e방주\u0026nbsp;최대의\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;행사\u0026nbsp;[아크\u0026nbsp;게임쇼]의\u0026nbsp;행사일이\u0026nbsp;코앞으로\u0026nbsp;다가왔다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e아크\u0026nbsp;게임쇼를\u0026nbsp;손꼽아\u0026nbsp;기다리던\u0026nbsp;일레그는\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;소중한\u0026nbsp;친구와\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;가기\u0026nbsp;위해,\u0026nbsp;오랫동안\u0026nbsp;닫혀있던\u0026nbsp;문을\u0026nbsp;두드리기로\u0026nbsp;한다.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eBOOMS\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;이벤트에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;획득하고\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;다양한\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점의\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;교환은\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;6일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;종료됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;6일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지]가\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eBOOMS\u0026nbsp;DAY\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;고난이도의\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;스테이지에\u0026nbsp;도전하여\u0026nbsp;각종\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득해\u0026nbsp;보세요!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.2\u0026nbsp;7\u0026nbsp;Days\u0026nbsp;Login\u0026nbsp;이벤트-\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eRETRO\u0026nbsp;GAME\u0026nbsp;WEEK\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;6일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;매일\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하여\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;7일까지\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;로그인\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료가\u0026nbsp;포함된\u0026nbsp;모든\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.3\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;Bunny\u0026nbsp;X\u0026nbsp;777\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;Bunny\u0026nbsp;X\u0026nbsp;777이\u0026nbsp;아카이브에\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;BOOMS\u0026nbsp;DAY에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트를\u0026nbsp;해금할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;[메모리\u0026nbsp;필름]을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;전초기지\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;커맨드\u0026nbsp;센터\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;회상\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.4\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e주말\u0026nbsp;FULL\u0026nbsp;BURST\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;24일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;26일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;2일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;4일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e주말\u0026nbsp;FULL\u0026nbsp;BURST\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;요격전\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸에서의\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;한\u0026nbsp;번\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.5\u0026nbsp;Daily\u0026nbsp;Bonus\u0026nbsp;Reward\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;24일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;26일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;2일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;4일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;일일\u0026nbsp;미션을\u0026nbsp;모두\u0026nbsp;완료하면\u0026nbsp;예상치\u0026nbsp;못한\u0026nbsp;추가\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.1\u0026nbsp;메인\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e메인\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;27챕터와\u0026nbsp;28챕터가\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;개방되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;챕터27:\u0026nbsp;설레고\u0026nbsp;두려운\u0026nbsp;[탐색]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;챕터28:\u0026nbsp;숨죽이고\u0026nbsp;있던\u0026nbsp;[미지]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e입장\u0026nbsp;조건:\u0026nbsp;26챕터\u0026nbsp;노멀\u0026nbsp;모드를\u0026nbsp;클리어한\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;입장할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.2\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터의\u0026nbsp;19섹터,\u0026nbsp;20섹터가\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드가\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;23일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;멤버들과\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;보스에\u0026nbsp;도전하세요.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;칩을\u0026nbsp;모으면\u0026nbsp;풍부한\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;23일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;29일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*참여\u0026nbsp;조건:\u0026nbsp;소속\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;레벨\u0026nbsp;3\u0026nbsp;달성\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유의\u0026nbsp;사항:\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드\u0026nbsp;시즌\u0026nbsp;중엔\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;탈퇴\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;구성원\u0026nbsp;추방을\u0026nbsp;할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.1\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;패키지가\u0026nbsp;갱신됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*판매\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;～\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;6일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e상세한\u0026nbsp;정보는\u0026nbsp;[로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;캐시\u0026nbsp;상점\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;패키지]에서\u0026nbsp;확인하여\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.2\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;Mission\u0026nbsp;Pass\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;1일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e0:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;31일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3월\u0026nbsp;프리미엄\u0026nbsp;패스\u0026nbsp;구매\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;일일\u0026nbsp;미션을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;Pass\u0026nbsp;레벨업\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;레벨을\u0026nbsp;달성하면\u0026nbsp;엑시아의\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;[게이머즈]를\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e개선\u0026nbsp;사항\u0026nbsp;\u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;기타\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.1\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e알려진 이슈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e회상\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠에서\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;재생\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;음성이\u0026nbsp;출력되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└해당\u0026nbsp;현상은\u0026nbsp;원인이\u0026nbsp;파악되어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;패치를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;수정될\u0026nbsp;예정입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e②\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;BGM이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└해당\u0026nbsp;현상은\u0026nbsp;원인이\u0026nbsp;파악되어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;패치를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;수정될\u0026nbsp;예정입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e③로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;난이도\u0026nbsp;조정\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;스테이지의\u0026nbsp;난이도가\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;적용된\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;해당\u0026nbsp;현상은\u0026nbsp;원인이\u0026nbsp;파악되어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;패치를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;수정될\u0026nbsp;예정입니다.\u0026nbsp;(2월\u0026nbsp;23일\u0026nbsp;공지\u0026nbsp;수정)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.2\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;크리스탈\u0026nbsp;체임버의\u0026nbsp;부위\u0026nbsp;파괴\u0026nbsp;효과음이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.3\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;전반적인\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;난이도가\u0026nbsp;하향\u0026nbsp;조정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.4\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e목단의\u0026nbsp;재장전\u0026nbsp;움직임을\u0026nbsp;좀\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;자연스럽게\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.5\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003ePC\u0026nbsp;런처에\u0026nbsp;설정\u0026nbsp;언어\u0026nbsp;1개(프랑스어)가\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;시스템\u0026nbsp;설정→통용\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;언어\u0026nbsp;설정을\u0026nbsp;변경하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\